WEBVTT

NOTE The walkthrough's voice, said in rw (§308.7). Times match the voice in how-booking-works.mp4; re-time these if the video is made again.

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.550
Gufata gahunda kuri BwanguReservations bimara munsi y’umunota umwe.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.400
Dore uko bikorwa.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.150
Banza ushake iduka rikwegereye.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.850
Shakisha icyo ukeneye, cyangwa uhitemo aho uzi.

5
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.250
Hitamo serivisi, uhitemo umunsi, ukande ku mwanya uboneka.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.500
Ubona ibiboneka ubu, kuva mu gitondo kugeza nimugoroba.

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.550
Fata umwanya wawe wishyura avansi nto, ukoresheje MTN Mobile Money.

8
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.200
Emeza kuri telefoni yawe, gahunda yawe ikaba yemejwe.

9
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.100
Uhabwa kode y’imibare 6.

10
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.050
Uyerekane ugeze ku muryango, iduka rikakwakira.

11
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.200
Nta jambo ry’ibanga, nta mpapuro.

12
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.000
BwanguReservations.

13
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.650
Gahunda zawe, nta guhamagara kuri telefoni.
